Native runtime (not included)
-----------------------------

This tree contains no browser engine, renderer binary, font or other native
runtime artifact. mioa_core can launch a separately obtained native runtime
only at a caller-supplied path; that program is not part of this distribution
and is licensed separately by its authors.

The development engine pinned by the source is Lightpanda Browser
(https://github.com/lightpanda-io/browser). Its LICENSE file is the GNU Affero
General Public License version 3 (AGPL-3.0) text. The alternate engine path
named in the source, Obscura, declares Apache-2.0. Neither program is
redistributed here,
and nothing in this notice grants rights to them. Operators who obtain or run
those programs are responsible for complying with their licenses.

Test fixture
------------

The string "hunter2" in mioa-headless/tests/test_axtree_observation.py is a
literal used to verify that password values are masked. It is not a
credential.
